# Vendored fixture bytes are the test content — CRLF fixtures
# (valid/newline-crlf.toml, valid/empty-crlf.toml,
# valid/string/multiline-escaped-crlf.toml) and the invalid-UTF-8 fixtures
# under invalid/encoding/ must round-trip byte-for-byte through git. Without
# this, a checkout with core.autocrlf=input/true silently rewrites CRLF to
# LF on `git add`, corrupting the exact cases those fixtures exist to test.
* -text
